Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20reposi=C3=A7=C3=A3o/transfer=C3=AAncia?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20avulsa=20parcial=20n=C3=A3o=20cancelava=20tarefa=20autom?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=A1tica/pulm=C3=A3o=20travada?=
